---
# title: "{{ edition.short_title }}"
# subtitle: "{{ edition.kicker }}"
---

:::{ .landing-title }

```{=html}
<div class="landing-title-image-wrap edition-title-image-wrap">
  <img
    class="landing-title-image"
    src="{{ edition.assets.landing_image | rel }}"
    alt="{{ edition.kicker }}: {{ edition.title }}{% if edition.conference is defined and edition.conference %} at {{ edition.conference }}{% endif %}">
</div>
```

<div class="subtitle">{{ edition.description }}</div>

<a class="btn-physnet" href="#program">View program</a>
{% if edition.urls is defined and edition.urls.original_site is defined and edition.urls.original_site %}<a class="btn-physnet secondary" href="{{ edition.urls.original_site }}">Original Google Site</a>{% endif %}
:::

::: {.event-summary}
::: {.summary-item}
**Date**  
{{ edition.date }}
:::

::: {.summary-item}
**Time**  
{{ edition.time }}
:::

::: {.summary-item}
**Venue**  
{% if edition.venue is defined and edition.venue.name is defined and edition.venue.name %}{{ edition.venue.name }}{% if edition.location is defined and edition.location %}, {{ edition.location }}{% endif %}{% elif edition.location is defined and edition.location %}{{ edition.location }}{% endif %}
:::

::: {.summary-item}
**Room**  
{% if edition.venue is defined and edition.venue.room is defined and edition.venue.room %}{{ edition.venue.room }}{% else %}TBA{% endif %}
:::
:::


## Speakers

::: {.speaker-grid}

{% for speaker in edition.speakers %}
::: {.speaker-card .with-photo}
<img class="speaker-photo" src="{{ speaker.image | rel if speaker.image is defined and speaker.image else edition.assets.speaker_placeholder | rel }}" alt="Portrait of {{ speaker.name }}" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='{{ edition.assets.speaker_placeholder | rel }}';">

### {{ speaker.name }}
{{ speaker.affiliation }}
:::

{% endfor %}
:::

## Program

::: {.program-list}

{% for item in edition.program %}
::: {.program-item{% if item.type == 'break' %} .break{% endif %}}
<div class="program-time">{{ item.time }}</div>
<div class="program-title">{{ item.title }}</div>
{% if item.presenter is defined and item.presenter %}<div class="program-speaker">{{ item.presenter }}</div>{% elif item.authors is defined and item.authors %}<div class="program-speaker">{{ item.authors | join(', ') }}</div>{% endif %}

{% if item.abstract is defined and item.abstract %}
<details>
<summary>Abstract</summary>

{{ item.abstract }}

</details>
{% endif %}
:::

{% endfor %}
:::

## Keywords

::: {.keyword-list}
{% for keyword in edition.keywords %}<span>{{ keyword }}</span>
{% endfor %}:::

## Organizers

::: {.organizer-grid}

{% for organizer in edition.organizers %}
::: {.speaker-card}
### {{ organizer.name }}
{{ organizer.affiliation }}
:::

{% endfor %}
:::

## Call for contributions

{% if edition.call_for_contributions is defined and edition.call_for_contributions and edition.call_for_contributions.status is defined and edition.call_for_contributions.status == "closed" -%}
The call for contributions is closed. This section is retained for archival reference.

{{ edition.call_for_contributions.description }}
{% elif edition.call_for_contributions is defined and edition.call_for_contributions -%}
{{ edition.call_for_contributions.description }}
{% else -%}
Call information is not available.
{% endif %}

## Archival note

::: {.archive-note}
{% if edition.urls is defined and edition.urls.original_site is defined and edition.urls.original_site %}Original public page: <{{ edition.urls.original_site }}>  {% endif %}
{% if edition.urls is defined and edition.urls.detailed_program is defined and edition.urls.detailed_program %}  
Detailed program page: <{{ edition.urls.detailed_program }}>  {% endif %}

This is a curated static reconstruction intended for long-term preservation on GitHub Pages.
:::
